OL,3,GNEWSAMatthew Rhys 'too scared' to talk
OL,4,Ato Harrison Ford about becoming Han
OL,5,ASolo
OL,6,
OL,7,FHollywood star Matthew Rhys has
OL,8,Frevealed he was "too scared" to talk to
OL,9,FHarrison Ford about being the voice of
OL,10,FHan Solo in a new Welsh language
OL,11,Fadaptation of Star Wars.
OL,13,FThe experience of taking on the iconic
OL,14,Frole was "weird", added the 51-year-old
OL,15,Ffrom Cardiff, who moved to the US to
OL,16,Fpursue a career in acting.
OL,18,FStar Wars will be dubbed in Welsh for
OL,19,Fthe first time ahead of the sci-fi
OL,20,Fclassic's 50th anniversary next year,
OL,21,Fand has been praised by the first
OL,22,Fminister.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
