OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the Welsh Conservatives called a
OL,8,F#100,000 contribution from the Welsh
OL,9,Fgovernment "out of touch" when
OL,10,Fthousands of NHS patients wait for
OL,11,Ftreatment.
